[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2824.83, "timestamp": "00:47:04", "text": "错误。我应该服用这个吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2833.109, "timestamp": "00:47:13", "text": "A. 这里有一件盔甲。二级。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2837.189, "timestamp": "00:47:17", "text": "天哪，我已经有盔甲了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2866.95, "timestamp": "00:47:46", "text": "离开。我认为霰弹枪和冲锋枪是不错的选择。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2869.109, "timestamp": "00:47:49", "text": "我想，这是一种策略吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2872.229, "timestamp": "00:47:52", "text": "对，我们上一场比赛就是这么赢的，当时我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2874.38, "timestamp": "00:47:54", "text": "把那堆东西卸下来了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2877.43, "timestamp": "00:47:57", "text": "[笑声]"}]